    "detailed_description": "Venture to the town of Apoth where many exciting adventures await.<br />\r\nDelve through randomly generated dungeons, sewers, caves, crypts and temples.<br />\r\nPick locked doors and chests, or just break them open.<br />\r\nBut be careful because items may be damaged in the process.<br />\r\nAlso, nearby monsters may hear the disturbance, and come looking for the source.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\nRandomized dungeons, treasures, traps, and monsters.<br />\r\nHundreds of different monsters to defeat.<br />\r\nThousands of different items to loot, equip, quaff and use.<br />\r\nDetect and disarm dozens of punishing traps.<br />\r\nCraft hundreds of different potions, armor, weapons and jewelry.<br />\r\nFive different difficulty settings from effortless to brutal.<br />\r\nClassless system with more than a hundred different skills to use.",
    "about_the_game": "Venture to the town of Apoth where many exciting adventures await.<br />\r\nDelve through randomly generated dungeons, sewers, caves, crypts and temples.<br />\r\nPick locked doors and chests, or just break them open.<br />\r\nBut be careful because items may be damaged in the process.<br />\r\nAlso, nearby monsters may hear the disturbance, and come looking for the source.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\nRandomized dungeons, treasures, traps, and monsters.<br />\r\nHundreds of different monsters to defeat.<br />\r\nThousands of different items to loot, equip, quaff and use.<br />\r\nDetect and disarm dozens of punishing traps.<br />\r\nCraft hundreds of different potions, armor, weapons and jewelry.<br />\r\nFive different difficulty settings from effortless to brutal.<br />\r\nClassless system with more than a hundred different skills to use.",
    "short_description": "Apoth is a real-time dungeon crawler with rogue-lite elements. Venture to the town of Apoth where many exciting adventures await. Delve through randomly generated dungeons, sewers, caves, crypts and temples.",
